{
    "title": "Classic Falling Brick",
    "description": "Step into the world of Classic Falling Brick, the premier mobile app for enthusiasts of the legendary puzzle game. Challenge yourself with hundreds of unique levels in this captivating Classic Falling Brick adventure. Play quick sessions to improve your score, or indulge in endless rounds to refine your skills in the Classic Falling Brick Single Player Modes. Classic Falling Brick forever!\r\n\r\nExperience the ultimate block puzzle game with these exciting features:\r\n\r\nTACKLE HUNDREDS OF CLASSIC FALLING BRICK LEVELS\r\n- Conquer challenging and enjoyable objectives in Classic Falling Brick.\r\n- A fresh take on the beloved block puzzle game!\r\n- Sharpen your skills by learning new techniques and overcoming the toughest levels.\r\n- Enjoy Classic Falling Brick like never before! Clear lines and solve intricate puzzles.\r\n\r\nCLASSIC FALLING BRICK SINGLE PLAYER \r\n- Master the gameplay with the iconic mechanics you love.\r\n- Choose Marathon mode for endless rounds or Quick Play Mode for brief, exciting sessions.\r\n- Rotate blocks, clear lines, and beat your high score.\r\n\r\nCUSTOMIZE YOUR GAMEPLAY \r\n- Complete Daily Challenges in your preferred modes to earn XP and rewards.\r\n- Opt for intuitive touch controls or on-screen controls.\r\n- Personalize your gaming experience and Player Profile with custom themes, backgrounds, avatars, and avatar frames.\r\n- Flaunt your unique style in Classic Falling Brick if you\u2019re featured in in-game videos.\r\n- The beloved block puzzle game is now available for everyone to enjoy anytime, anywhere\r\n\r\nTerms of service: https://lemonade-games.com/terms.html\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://lemonade-games.com/privacy.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Step into the world of Classic Falling Brick, the premier mobile app for enthusiasts of the legendary puzzle game. Challenge yourself with hundreds of unique levels in this captivating Classic Falling Brick adventure. Play quick sessions to improve your score, or indulge in endless rounds to refine your skills in the Classic Falling Brick Single Player Modes. Classic Falling Brick forever!<br><br>Experience the ultimate block puzzle game with these exciting features:<br><br>TACKLE HUNDREDS OF CLASSIC FALLING BRICK LEVELS<br>- Conquer challenging and enjoyable objectives in Classic Falling Brick.<br>- A fresh take on the beloved block puzzle game!<br>- Sharpen your skills by learning new techniques and overcoming the toughest levels.<br>- Enjoy Classic Falling Brick like never before! Clear lines and solve intricate puzzles.<br><br>CLASSIC FALLING BRICK SINGLE PLAYER <br>- Master the gameplay with the iconic mechanics you love.<br>- Choose Marathon mode for endless rounds or Quick Play Mode for brief, exciting sessions.<br>- Rotate blocks, clear lines, and beat your high score.<br><br>CUSTOMIZE YOUR GAMEPLAY <br>- Complete Daily Challenges in your preferred modes to earn XP and rewards.<br>- Opt for intuitive touch controls or on-screen controls.<br>- Personalize your gaming experience and Player Profile with custom themes, backgrounds, avatars, and avatar frames.<br>- Flaunt your unique style in Classic Falling Brick if you\u2019re featured in in-game videos.<br>- The beloved block puzzle game is now available for everyone to enjoy anytime, anywhere<br><br>Terms of service: https://lemonade-games.com/terms.html<br>Privacy Policy: https://lemonade-games.com/privacy.html",
